  client --> CFR001 : View Financial Insights Dashboard\nClient wants to understand their financial health.\nCFR002: Receive Alerts for Anomalous Transactions\nClient seeks real-time fraud detection.\nCFR003: Access Predictive Analytics\nClient needs forward-looking data.\nCFR004: Get Personalized Advice\nClient requires tailored recommendations.\nCFR005: Adjust Recommendation Settings\nClient wants control over their advice preferences.\nCFR006: Track Spending Limits\nClient aims to manage budgeting effectively.\nCFR007: Discover Investment Options\nClient looks for portfolio diversification opportunities.\nCFR008: Stay Updated on News\nClient desires market intelligence related to investments.\nCFR009: Consolidate Financial Views\nClient seeks a single view of all financial data.\nSAFR002: Manage System Notifications\nSysAdmin adjusts alert settings.\nFAFR001: Schedule Mentoring Sessions\nAdvisor plans client interactions.\nFAFR003: View Client Alerts\nAdvisor monitors user issues.\nSFR010: Create Dashboards\nSystem generates consolidated views for clients.\nAIFR002: Analyze Recommendations\nAI system provides personalized guidance.
  
  SysAdmin --> SAFR004 : Configure System Parameters\nSysAdmin adjusts analysis settings to comply with regulations like Basel III, GDPR etc.\nSAFR001: Manage Analysis Settings\nSysAdmin oversees AI parameter management for accuracy and compliance.\nFAAFR003: Generate Predictive Interventions\nAdvisor receives data-driven guidance on client engagement.\nAIFR008: Recommend Proactive Actions\nAI system suggests actions to advisors based on user patterns.\nCFR011: Provide Feedback\nUser reports issues or improvements for the AI model.

  FAFR002 --> CFR007 : Manage Investment Opportunities\nAdvisor controls which opportunities are presented to clients.\nFAFR004 --> SFR006 : Configure Risk Profiles\nAdvisor sets client-specific risk parameters for investment recommendations.\nAIFR005: Align with Client Goals\nAI system tailors investments per user's financial objectives and risk tolerance (e.g., MiFID II).\nSFR013: Notify on Alerts\nSystem alerts users via appropriate channels when thresholds are breached or changes occur.

